# Research Papers

This folder contains research-paper information supporting the literature review for the proposed Multi-Layered Data Loss Prevention (DLP) Framework.

The papers focus on:
- Data Loss Prevention
- Insider Threat Detection
- User and Entity Behavior Analytics (UEBA)
- Automated Sensitive Data Classification
- Context-Aware Data Detection

Each paper is analysed based on its research problem, methodology, dataset/tools, findings, limitations, and relevance to the proposed research.
